      "created_at": "2016-11-26T03:42:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Had an odd bug happen, was wondering if anyone else had it happen to them.</p><p>In a match in the Temple of Zhu Long, Argent Adept ended up with a Shinobi Assassin on top of his deck. I played an Instrumental Conjuration to search the deck for an instrument, at which point the deck should have shuffled. However, it did not.</p><p>Odd thing was, the next turn I played another Instrumental Conjuration, and this time the deck&nbsp;<em>did</em> shuffle. It was odd, and I can't think of any reason why the deck shouldn't have shuffled the first time.</p><p>Anyone else run into this?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:25.220Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
