      "raw": "[quote=\"Powerhound_2000\"]\n\nI haven't.  Do you have the game log by any chance?   There is an off chance that after the shuffle and draw that the Assassin is still on top.  \n\n[/quote]\n\nAh, I play on a Nook, so I'm not sure I could access the log if I wanted to.\n\nBut I know something was off here. I didnt hear the shuffle sound after searching the deck. And I rewound to replay the card several times and had the same result multiple times in a row; I'm assuming the shuffle shouldn't have put the same card on top again and again.\n\nAnd yes, the rewinding made sure I could verify I was searching the deck.\n\nIt might just be a one off, given that it disn't repeat in the same match, but I wanted to see if there was something maybe I missed.",
