      "created_at": "2016-11-27T23:40:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Per the card, a shuffle is supposed to occur before a draw if the Instrument was searched for in the deck. &nbsp;As to confirm whether the game handled it that in this specific case we would need a log but I'm not sure how you'd get that from a Nook. &nbsp; Also, if another game has been played since then we won't have a log anymore. &nbsp; The only piece I can recommend is that if it's seen in the future click on credits on the main screen and click Submit feedback this should send the log file for Handelbra to review. &nbsp;</p>",
