      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-03T02:24:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had basically this same thing happen during the weekly one shot.&nbsp; I put a Shinobi on top of Fixer's deck and then used Meditation to search his deck and shuffle it.&nbsp; Then on my draw phase I drew the Shinobi.&nbsp; Since the draw was on my draw phase instead of from the card as with the Instrumental Conjuration example, the shuffle clearly had to happen first.&nbsp; So either something causes the Shinobi to stay on top of the deck (whether intentional or a bug) or I just got unlucky with the shuffle.</p>",
